        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "50cba5a1-48eb-5a9e-aaf3-e486e13bbe0d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 391,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:3",
          "start": 268
        },
        "quote": "(d) All side lot lines shall be at right angles to straight street lines, or radial to curved street lines in subdivisions.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.40.110 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "5f7490d6-9cee-5360-be52-3c1662ebd728",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 618,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:4",
          "start": 392
        },
        "quote": "(e) All corner lots in subdivisions shall have a minimum building setback of 30 feet to both streets, unless certain conditions such as topography, street alignment or adjacent setbacks warrant a deviation in this requirement.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.40.110 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "9c83b7d7-2e10-51a4-b535-9dcb8e1c8921",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 806,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:5",
          "start": 619
        },
        "quote": "(f) Double frontage lots in a subdivision shall be avoided unless, in the opinion of the Planning Commission, variation to this rule will give better street alignment and lot arrangement.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.40.110 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "70373451-c249-5a71-af91-9d29b84bea66",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 874,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:6",
          "start": 807
        },
        "quote": "(g) Every lot in a subdivision shall have a frontage upon a street.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.110:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.40.110 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "df94384a-6da2-5cae-9584-920c621abed8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
